munich_sample.h5 is a subset of the linkgym Munich ray-traced channel traces v1 (the
first 1000 slots of four trajectories), made with examples/rt/make_sample.py.
munich_paths_sample.h5 holds the ray-traced paths of the first 100 slots of the same four
trajectories (trace format 2), solved again with the same configuration and made with
examples/rt/make_paths_sample.py.

